# basePath Test

:: BasicTest
@trigger TestTrigger
@cutscene
$wait 5
{@Player}   Hi! I'm Locke! The protagonist, I think.
            And maybe something more?
{@Dorian}   And <b>I'm</b> the Best Friend!
            For now!
{@Player}   A little ominous there, but sure!
            Welcome to the Constance!
            ...is what I would be saying if we were on a ship.
            Currently we're just floating in a vacuum.
{@Dorian}   But how are we breathing, Locke???
{@Player}   You're safe, Dorian, you're just on a Zip call with me.
            I... uh...{wait 1} hang on.
            ...{close}
$wait 1
{@Dorian}   Oh damn, he might be suffocating.
            ...
            Sucks to be him, there's money I could be making.
{@PAL}      {quip}I had {wait 0.1}no role in this disaster! 

:: FirstContractOpen
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once
{@PAL}      Just select the job you want to do and CONFIRM it!
{@Player}   Thanks, PAL.